{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And it shall be his.</b> This covenant of Mine." "<b>A covenant of eternal priesthood.</b> For even though the priesthood had already been given to the seed of Aaron, it was given only to Aaron and to his sons who were anointed with him and to their descendants born after their anointing — but Phinehas, who was born beforehand and was not anointed, was not included in the priesthood until now. And so we learned in Zevachim (101a): Phinehas was not invested as priest until he killed Zimri." "<b>For his Elohim.</b> On behalf of his Elohim, as in ״הַמְקַנֵּא אַתָּה לִי״ (Numbers 11), ״וְקִנֵּאתִי לְצִיּוֹן״ (Zechariah 8) — on behalf of Zion."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:46.107477314Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}